{"3383510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Expedition to Madness", "steam_appid": 3383510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expedition to Madness</strong> is a 1–4 player co-op Lovecraftian investigation horror game where you enter unstable dimensions, study impossible phenomena, identify the entity haunting each world, and decide how much longer you dare remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of an inter-dimensional expedition searching for your missing partner, Emily, lost somewhere beyond the folds of reality. Each mission sends you through a wormhole into a corrupted world filled with signs, anomalies, and ancient intelligences that do not want to be understood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INVESTIGATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just about survival.<br>Study the environment. Track manifestations. Gather clues. Compare evidence. Determine what kind of cosmic presence has taken hold before it is too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/3b2ccbb13588b34bebd1fd48faa9221a.poster.avif?t=1781501760\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/3b2ccbb13588b34bebd1fd48faa9221a.webm?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/3b2ccbb13588b34bebd1fd48faa9221a.mp4?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dimension hides its own logic, its own threats, and its own truths. Misread the signs, and your team may not make it back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse unstable wormholes into terrifying <strong>parallel dimensions inspired by Lovecraft’s</strong> most iconic stories. From the icy ruins of <i>At the Mountains of Madness</i> to the cursed coastlines of <i>Innsmouth</i>, each mission takes you deeper into a multiverse of horrors and hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/53c09244796c5da035d8c885fcfd5ff4.poster.avif?t=1781501760\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/53c09244796c5da035d8c885fcfd5ff4.webm?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/53c09244796c5da035d8c885fcfd5ff4.mp4?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>primordial energy</strong>, recover ancient artifacts, and piece together clues from Emily’s scattered journal. But be warned: unspeakable entities hunt in the dark, and the deeper you go, the harder it is to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/449c7eb74de49cd47bb63fb835ded290.poster.avif?t=1781501760\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/449c7eb74de49cd47bb63fb835ded290.webm?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/449c7eb74de49cd47bb63fb835ded290.mp4?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the unknown. Stabilize the wormhole. Discover what happened to her and escape with what you found before the dimension collapses around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some entities can be avoided. Some can be resisted. Some should never be approached at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/37fa4761e1aa2b8859cd75107277f4c8.poster.avif?t=1781501760\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/37fa4761e1aa2b8859cd75107277f4c8.webm?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/37fa4761e1aa2b8859cd75107277f4c8.mp4?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 Player Online Co-op:</strong> nvestigate alone or with up to three other explorers in tense cooperative expeditions. Every run is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian Investigation Horror:</strong> Gather clues, analyze paranormal events, and identify the cosmic force haunting each dimension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiversal Worlds of Dread: </strong>Explore shifting realities inspired by Lovecraftian fiction, each with distinct atmosphere, dangers, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction Under Pressure: </strong>Balance greed and survival as you collect primordial energy and artifacts before your expedition falls apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Discovery:</strong> Uncover Emily’s fate through journal entries, strange phenomena, and clues across worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian Enemies:</strong> Face creatures that defy logic, some you can run from, others you must challenge… or avoid entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Progression: </strong>Sell what you recover to upgrade your equipment and unlock access to deeper, stranger, and deadlier dimensions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Objectives:</strong> Choose what to investigate, what to risk, what to take, and when to run.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expedition to Madness</strong> is a 1–4 player co-op Lovecraftian investigation horror game where you enter unstable dimensions, study impossible phenomena, identify the entity haunting each world, and decide how much longer you dare remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of an inter-dimensional expedition searching for your missing partner, Emily, lost somewhere beyond the folds of reality. Each mission sends you through a wormhole into a corrupted world filled with signs, anomalies, and ancient intelligences that do not want to be understood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INVESTIGATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just about survival.<br>Study the environment. Track manifestations. Gather clues. Compare evidence. Determine what kind of cosmic presence has taken hold before it is too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/3b2ccbb13588b34bebd1fd48faa9221a.poster.avif?t=1781501760\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/3b2ccbb13588b34bebd1fd48faa9221a.webm?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/3b2ccbb13588b34bebd1fd48faa9221a.mp4?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dimension hides its own logic, its own threats, and its own truths. Misread the signs, and your team may not make it back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse unstable wormholes into terrifying <strong>parallel dimensions inspired by Lovecraft’s</strong> most iconic stories. From the icy ruins of <i>At the Mountains of Madness</i> to the cursed coastlines of <i>Innsmouth</i>, each mission takes you deeper into a multiverse of horrors and hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/53c09244796c5da035d8c885fcfd5ff4.poster.avif?t=1781501760\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/53c09244796c5da035d8c885fcfd5ff4.webm?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/53c09244796c5da035d8c885fcfd5ff4.mp4?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>primordial energy</strong>, recover ancient artifacts, and piece together clues from Emily’s scattered journal. But be warned: unspeakable entities hunt in the dark, and the deeper you go, the harder it is to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/449c7eb74de49cd47bb63fb835ded290.poster.avif?t=1781501760\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/449c7eb74de49cd47bb63fb835ded290.webm?t=1781501760\" type=\"video/webm; codec