d artifacts before your expedition falls apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Discovery:</strong> Uncover Emily’s fate through journal entries, strange phenomena, and clues across worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian Enemies:</strong> Face creatures that defy logic, some you can run from, others you must challenge… or avoid entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Progression: </strong>Sell what you recover to upgrade your equipment and unlock access to deeper, stranger, and deadlier dimensions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Objectives:</strong> Choose what to investigate, what to risk, what to take, and when to run.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "1–4 player co-op Lovecraftian horror. Investigate paranormal phenomena across unstable dimensions, identify the entity haunting each world, extract primordial energy and escape before the wormhole collapses.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/0540d5212e5f14489272b39637d4100e4d495043/header.jpg?t=1781501760", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/dcdb65f5b06bdc1392eb9651e41631a47cc0aaf0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781501760", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/dcdb65f5b06bdc1392eb9651e41631a47cc0aaf0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781501760", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Net